  "question": {
    "text": "The first of the two samples in a group has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> items with mean <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> and standard deviation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the whole group has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn></math> items with mean <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and standard deviation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>44</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the standard deviation of the second sample is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>",
